@LondonStyle.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5037

### Health Check
GET {{LondonStyle.API_HostAddress}}/api/textanalysis/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Analyze Text
POST {{LondonStyle.API_HostAddress}}/api/textanalysis/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "The document was reviewed by the committee. It was determined that the budget allocation requires immediate attention.",
  "tone": "GovernmentProfessional",
  "targetGradeLevel": 7
}

###

### Simplify Sentence
POST {{LondonStyle.API_HostAddress}}/api/textanalysis/simplify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sentence": "The aforementioned documentation was thoroughly examined by the oversight committee.",
  "targetGradeLevel": 7
}

###

